{"seq":1,"slug":"circuit-basics","title":"九年级物理 — 电路基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/circuit-basics","wordCount":1153,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"九年级物理-电路基础\">九年级物理 — 电路基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>电学是九年级物理的核心内容，电路基础是学习电学的起点。学生需要掌握电荷、电流、电压和电阻的基本概念，理解串联电路和并联电路的特点，学会使用电流表和电压表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理量</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>测量工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电流</td>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>安培(A)</td>\n<td>电流表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电压</td>\n<td>U</td>\n<td>伏特(V)</td>\n<td>电压表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电阻</td>\n<td>R</td>\n<td>欧姆(Ω)</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>电路的三种状态：通路（正常工作）、断路（开路，电流为零）、短路（危险，电流过大）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"电荷与电流\">电荷与电流</h3><p>自然界中有两种电荷：正电荷和负电荷。同种电荷相互排斥，异种电荷相互吸引。电荷的定向移动形成电流，规定正电荷移动的方向为电流方向。</p>\n<p>在金属导体中，自由电子是载流子，电子移动的方向与电流方向相反。电流的大小用电流强度表示，I = Q/t（电流 = 电荷量/时间）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"串联电路与并联电路\">串联电路与并联电路</h3><p>串联电路的特点：电流只有一条路径，各处电流相等（I = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；电压等于各部分电压之和（U = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；一个元件断路，整个电路断路。</p>\n<p>并联电路的特点：电流有多条路径，干路电流等于各支路电流之和（I = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；各支路电压相等（U = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；一条支路断路不影响其他支路。</p>\n<p>判断串并联的方法：若两个用电器首尾相连，是串联；若两个用电器两端分别连在一起，是并联。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电流表和电压表的使用\">电流表和电压表的使用</h3><p>电流表：串联在电路中，正接线柱接电源正极方向，不能直接接在电源两端。量程选择：先估算电流大小，选合适量程（0-0.6A或0-3A）。</p>\n<p>电压表：并联在被测电路两端，正接线柱接电源正极方向，可以直接接在电源两端（测电源电压）。量程选择：先估算电压大小，选合适量程（0-3V或0-15V）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电阻\">电阻</h3><p>电阻是导体对电流的阻碍作用。影响电阻大小的因素有：导体的材料、长度、横截面积和温度。材料相同时，导体越长电阻越大，横截面积越大电阻越小。</p>\n<p>导体的电阻是导体本身的属性，与是否通电、电流大小和电压大小无关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电路图与实物图\">电路图与实物图</h3><p>电路图使用统一的电路符号来表示电路连接方式。中考常考的技能是：根据电路图连接实物图，或根据实物图画出电路图。</p>\n<p>画电路图和连接实物图的基本规则：导线不能交叉，电路元件要用标准符号，电流方向要正确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>判断以下电路是串联还是并联，并说明理由。画出对应的电路图。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在一个串联电路中，电源电压为6V，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>两端电压为2V，求<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>两端的电压。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>正确连接实验电路：将一个灯泡、一个开关和一个电流表串联，再将电压表并联在灯泡两端，画出电路图。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>中考模拟：一段导体的电阻为10Ω，将它拉长为原来的2倍后，电阻变为多少？解释原因。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>电路基础知识在日常生活中无处不在。家庭电路中的灯和插座是并联连接的，这样一个灯坏了不影响其他灯的使用。理解电路的基本原理，有助于安全用电和简单电器故障的排查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>电路基础是九年级电学的起点。掌握电流、电压、电阻三个基本概念，理解串联和并联电路的特点，学会正确使用电流表和电压表。做到&quot;概念清晰、电路识别准确、仪表使用规范&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"ohms-law\">欧姆定律</a> —— 在认清电流、电压、电阻三量与串并联结构后，下一步就是用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I=U/R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 把三者定量联系起来，电路图分析是欧姆定律计算的入口。</li>\n<li>同 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"electrical-power\">电功率</a> —— 电路结构搞清后，才能进一步计算各用电器消耗电能的快慢。</li>\n<li>跨 hub（八年级物理·力学）：<a href=\"../../../grade-8/physics/mechanics/force-concepts\">力的概念</a> —— 电流是电荷在电场力作用下的定向移动，理解&quot;力推动物体运动&quot;有助于建立&quot;电场力推动电荷&quot;的类比直觉。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"九年级物理 — 电路基础","id":"九年级物理-电路基础"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"电荷与电流","id":"电荷与电流"},{"level":3,"text":"串联电路与并联电路","id":"串联电路与并联电路"},{"level":3,"text":"电流表和电压表的使用","id":"电流表和电压表的使用"},{"level":3,"text":"电阻","id":"电阻"},{"level":3,"text":"电路图与实物图","id":"电路图与实物图"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"九年级物理 — 欧姆定律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/electricity/ohms-law"}}